@startuml 12-seq-web-overlay
!include _style.iuml
title Live web branching: genesis, overlay, upstream as a peer

actor "Browser" as b
participant "xtxp.link\ngateway" as gw
participant "Server MUPPET" as sm
participant "Trackers\n@live + branches" as t
participant "Origin site" as o

b -> gw : GET /en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Browser@live
gw -> t : document exists?
t --> gw : no
gw -> o : GET /wiki/Browser\n(no cookies, no credentials)
o --> gw : HTML
gw -> sm : genesis(HTML)
sm -> sm : HTML5 parse → tree,\nassign stable node IDs
sm -> t : vector 0 on @live\n(upstream snapshot)
sm --> gw : rendered page
gw --> b : page with every link rewritten to\nxtxp.link/…@live, origin forms disabled

b -> gw : POST edit
gw -> sm : edit intent
sm -> t : fork @live → branch b1,\nXTXP ops on b1
gw --> b : 303 → /en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Browser@b1\n(frame: "edited branch", links to @live)

== later: origin page changes ==
gw -> o : re-fetch
o --> gw : new HTML
gw -> sm : diff against last upstream snapshot
sm -> t : ops by the upstream peer on @live
t -> t : branches take in @live changes\nlike any other peer's edits
@enduml
